div.p:
“1. Taking into consideration documents which are considered precedents of UN
                    charter prove intention their authors was establish universality of organization
                    in such way it wld include all nations and states of mankind;

“2. Taking into consideration this universality is established in charter where
                    it has been provided membership open to all peace-loving nations, only condition
                    being members promise fulfil obligations charter;

“5. Taking into consideration advisory opinion ICJ entirely agreement with well
                    known rule of law that it is not possible exercise power discretionally when
                    there are objective facts or rules for exercise such a power;

list.item:
“(1). Declare that judgment of organization on admission new members
                            ought be based exclusively on juridical conditions established by
                            Article 4 of charter;
